{"number":88,"name":"سُورَةُ الغَاشِيَةِ","englishName":"Al-Ghaashiya","englishNameTranslation":"The Overwhelming","numberOfAyahs":26,"items":[{"id":"q:88:1","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":1,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ هَلْ أَتَىٰكَ حَدِيثُ ٱلْغَٰشِيَةِ","en":"Has there reached you the report of the Overwhelming [event]?","bn":"আপনার কাছে আচ্ছন্নকারী কেয়ামতের বৃত্তান্ত পৌঁছেছে কি?","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/1"},{"id":"q:88:2","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":2,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وُجُوهٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍ خَٰشِعَةٌ","en":"[Some] faces, that Day, will be humbled,","bn":"অনেক মুখমন্ডল সেদিন হবে লাঞ্ছিত,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/2"},{"id":"q:88:3","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":3,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"عَامِلَةٌۭ نَّاصِبَةٌۭ","en":"Working [hard] and exhausted.","bn":"ক্লিষ্ট, ক্লান্ত।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/3"},{"id":"q:88:4","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":4,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"تَصْلَىٰ نَارًا حَامِيَةًۭ","en":"They will [enter to] burn in an intensely hot Fire.","bn":"তারা জ্বলন্ত আগুনে পতিত হবে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/4"},{"id":"q:88:5","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":5,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"تُسْقَىٰ مِنْ عَيْنٍ ءَانِيَةٍۢ","en":"They will be given drink from a boiling spring.","bn":"তাদেরকে ফুটন্ত নহর থেকে পান করানো হবে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/5"},{"id":"q:88:6","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":6,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"لَّيْسَ لَهُمْ طَعَامٌ إِلَّا مِن ضَرِيعٍۢ","en":"For them there will be no food except from a poisonous, thorny plant","bn":"কন্টকপূর্ণ ঝাড় ব্যতীত তাদের জন্যে কোন খাদ্য নেই।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/6"},{"id":"q:88:7","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":7,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"لَّا يُسْمِنُ وَلَا يُغْنِى مِن جُوعٍۢ","en":"Which neither nourishes nor avails against hunger.","bn":"এটা তাদেরকে পুষ্ট করবে না এবং ক্ষুধায়ও উপকার করবে না।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/7"},{"id":"q:88:8","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":8,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وُجُوهٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ نَّاعِمَةٌۭ","en":"[Other] faces, that Day, will show pleasure.","bn":"অনেক মুখমন্ডল সেদিন হবে, সজীব,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/8"},{"id":"q:88:9","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":9,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"لِّسَعْيِهَا رَاضِيَةٌۭ","en":"With their effort [they are] satisfied","bn":"তাদের কর্মের কারণে সন্তুষ্ট।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/9"},{"id":"q:88:10","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":10,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فِى جَنَّةٍ عَالِيَةٍۢ","en":"In an elevated garden,","bn":"তারা থাকবে, সুউচ্চ জান্নাতে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/10"},{"id":"q:88:11","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":11,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"لَّا تَسْمَعُ فِيهَا لَٰغِيَةًۭ","en":"Wherein they will hear no unsuitable speech.","bn":"তথায় শুনবে না কোন অসার কথাবার্তা।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/11"},{"id":"q:88:12","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":12,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فِيهَا عَيْنٌۭ جَارِيَةٌۭ","en":"Within it is a flowing spring.","bn":"তথায় থাকবে প্রবাহিত ঝরণা।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/12"},{"id":"q:88:13","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":13,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فِيهَا سُرُرٌۭ مَّرْفُوعَةٌۭ","en":"Within it are couches raised high","bn":"তথায় থাকবে উন্নত সুসজ্জিত আসন।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/13"},{"id":"q:88:14","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":14,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَأَكْوَابٌۭ مَّوْضُوعَةٌۭ","en":"And cups put in place","bn":"এবং সংরক্ষিত পানপাত্র","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/14"},{"id":"q:88:15","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":15,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَنَمَارِقُ مَصْفُوفَةٌۭ","en":"And cushions lined up","bn":"এবং সারি সারি গালিচা","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/15"},{"id":"q:88:16","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":16,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَزَرَابِىُّ مَبْثُوثَةٌ","en":"And carpets spread around.","bn":"এবং বিস্তৃত বিছানো কার্পেট।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/16"},{"id":"q:88:17","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":17,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"أَفَلَا يَنظُرُونَ إِلَى ٱلْإِبِلِ كَيْفَ خُلِقَتْ","en":"Then do they not look at the camels - how they are created?","bn":"তারা কি উষ্ট্রের প্রতি লক্ষ্য করে না যে, তা কিভাবে সৃষ্টি করা হয়েছে?","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/17"},{"id":"q:88:18","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":18,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَإِلَى ٱلسَّمَآءِ كَيْفَ رُفِعَتْ","en":"And at the sky - how it is raised?","bn":"এবং আকাশের প্রতি লক্ষ্য করে না যে, তা কিভাবে উচ্চ করা হয়েছে?","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/18"},{"id":"q:88:19","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":19,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَإِلَى ٱلْجِبَالِ كَيْفَ نُصِبَتْ","en":"And at the mountains - how they are erected?","bn":"এবং পাহাড়ের দিকে যে, তা কিভাবে স্থাপন করা হয়েছে?","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/19"},{"id":"q:88:20","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":20,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَإِلَى ٱلْأَرْضِ كَيْفَ سُطِحَتْ","en":"And at the earth - how it is spread out?","bn":"এবং পৃথিবীর দিকে যে, তা কিভাবে সমতল বিছানো হয়েছে?","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/20"},{"id":"q:88:21","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":21,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَذَكِّرْ إِنَّمَآ أَنتَ مُذَكِّرٌۭ","en":"So remind, [O Muhammad]; you are only a reminder.","bn":"অতএব, আপনি উপদেশ দিন, আপনি তো কেবল একজন উপদেশদাতা,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/21"},{"id":"q:88:22","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":22,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"لَّسْتَ عَلَيْهِم بِمُصَيْطِرٍ","en":"You are not over them a controller.","bn":"আপনি তাদের শাসক নন,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/22"},{"id":"q:88:23","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":23,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"إِلَّا مَن تَوَلَّىٰ وَكَفَرَ","en":"However, he who turns away and disbelieves -","bn":"কিন্তু যে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয় ও কাফের হয়ে যায়,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/23"},{"id":"q:88:24","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":24,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَيُعَذِّبُهُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلْعَذَابَ ٱلْأَكْبَرَ","en":"Then Allah will punish him with the greatest punishment.","bn":"আল্লাহ তাকে মহা আযাব দেবেন।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/24"},{"id":"q:88:25","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":25,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"إِنَّ إِلَيْنَآ إِيَابَهُمْ","en":"Indeed, to Us is their return.","bn":"নিশ্চয় তাদের প্রত্যাবর্তন আমারই নিকট,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/25"},{"id":"q:88:26","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":88,"ayah":26,"surahName":"Al-Ghaashiya","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ثُمَّ إِنَّ عَلَيْنَا حِسَابَهُم","en":"Then indeed, upon Us is their account.","bn":"অতঃপর তাদের হিসাব-নিকাশ আমারই দায়িত্ব।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/88/26"}]}